# Every slice

1. Draw the diamond (nodes, IN/OUT, edges). Zero independent jobs → loop
   yourself.
2. Fan out only file-disjoint worktrees. One git-mutation owner each.
3. Reduce in code (SHAs, test counts). Do not LLM-“combine.”
4. Fresh-context reviewer on `origin/main...HEAD`. Worker ≠ reviewer.
5. `git push -u origin HEAD` → `gh pr create --repo delimatsuo/heykevin` →
   `gh pr merge --merge` if reviewed-clean and not owner-gated. Feature rebase:
   `git push --force-with-lease origin <feature-branch>` only.
6. Stage explicit paths. Never `git add -A`, `--no-verify`, or git config.
7. Before “done”:
   `PATH="/Volumes/Extreme Pro/MYPROJECTS/Kevin/.venv/bin:$PATH" python -m pytest -q`
   Do not export `TWILIO_*` / `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` / `USER_PHONE` at process
   start (visual-diagnosis env snapshot). iOS: `xcodegen generate` if
   `ios/project.yml` changed.
8. Mutation-check new guards. Quote plan criteria; don’t paraphrase.
   Fixture ≠ live Gemini. Default-off on `main` ≠ flags on.

